  "html": "<div id=\"question-350261\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">5.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/2457#22017\">Identifying True Statements in Context</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"350261\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Maya and Priya are café owners. In the previous season, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"34\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c25\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>55</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of Maya’s orders were takeout, while the decimal proportion of Priya’s orders that were takeout was <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"35\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c38\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.8</mn><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Which of the following statements are true?</p>\n<ol class=\"questionStatements\"><li>  Less than half of Maya's orders were takeout. </li><li>  More than half of Priya's orders were takeout. </li><li>  Maya had a greater percentage of takeout orders compared to Priya. </li></ol></div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 3:57 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:36</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
